{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/kickstarter-logo-green.png?t=1743389406\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will be hosting a crowdfunding campaign. Pre-Release page out, find us on Kickstarter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/ValenciaRain2.gif?t=1743389406\" /><strong>Project Mix</strong> is a VR anime narrative game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in the red light district of Mong Kok, you play as Rone, a young former thug starting a new beginning to try leave behind his life of crime. He unexpectedly becomes a bartender after a chance meeting with Valencia, the eccentric bar owner of Eleventh Heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> At first, you live by the paycheck working at Eleventh Heaven, but as you find yourself hearing a bit too much for your own good, you find yourself thrown into a deep conspiracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/TrailerGif.gif?t=1743389406\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet 8 unique customers and learn about the city from differing perspectives. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/KatieGif.gif?t=1743389406\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shake, pour, decorate, and serve. Interactive bartending mechanics built from the ground up for VR. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What you choose to serve changes the lives of your clients, and even the game narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/DrinksGif.gif?t=1743389406\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A focus on the small and subtle moments, such as having a smoke after work, sharing a drink, petting your cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/Smoking.gif?t=1743389406\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world through gorgeous and atmospheric environments featuring stylized anime visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/project-mix-smoking-cat.gif?t=1743389406\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heavy storytelling focus, visual novel narrative set in a rich cyberpunk world. There will be three romance paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack tailored especially for the game, ranging from jazz, synthpop to citypop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2439770?t=1743389406","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/ffcda2be758909ff52e4a01d7bc2de801091cde7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743389406","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/9f0b82653958205fd2c18ac6bd0c7ef2afd49293/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743389406","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/9f0b82653958205fd2c18ac6bd0c7ef2afd49293/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743389406","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"There is strong sexual language, but any sexual content will be implied and not shown explicitly. Expect lots of suggestive and risque fan service elements though. There is alcohol drinking and bartending in the game. There is also smoking, but that is optional. The game is for mature audiences."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/kickstarter-logo-green.png?t=1743389406\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We will be hosting a crowdfunding campaign. Pre-Release page out, find us on Kickstarter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/ValenciaRain2.gif?t=1743389406\" /><strong>Project Mix</strong> is a VR anime narrative game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in the red light district of Mong Kok, you play as Rone, a young former thug starting a new beginning to try leave behind his life of crime. He unexpectedly becomes a bartender after a chance meeting with Valencia, the eccentric bar owner of Eleventh Heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> At first, you live by the paycheck working at Eleventh Heaven, but as you find yourself hearing a bit too much for your own good, you find yourself thrown into a deep conspiracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/TrailerGif.gif?t=1743389406\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet 8 unique customers and learn about the city from differing perspectives. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/KatieGif.gif?t=1743389406\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shake, pour, decorate, and serve. Interactive bartending mechanics built from the ground up for VR. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What you choose to serve changes the lives of your clients, and even the game narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/DrinksGif.gif?t=1743389406\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A focus on the small and subtle moments, such as having a smoke after work, sharing a drink, petting your cat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/Smoking.gif?t=1743389406\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the world through gorgeous and atmospheric environments featuring stylized anime visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/extras/project-mix-smoking-cat.gif?t=1743389406\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heavy storytelling focus, visual novel narrative set in a rich cyberpunk world. There will be three romance paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack tailored especially for the game, ranging from jazz, synthpop to citypop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","developers":["PLECTRUM SOFT"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439770/2fadcab6477c13391145c4846406ed99624563cc/header.jpg?t=1743389406","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2023 Plectrum Software. \u201cProject Mix\u201d is a registered trademark of Plectrum Software. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\